    <item>
      <title>Some of my Autumn 2026 festival shows</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/some-upcoming-festival-dates/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:42:12 -0400</pubDate>
      <author>vinnyseeram@vinnyseeram.com (Vinny Seeram)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/some-upcoming-festival-dates/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ll traveling to perform in some festivals this Fall&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Saturday, October 3rd, 6:30 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;saturday-october-3rd-630-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#saturday-october-3rd-630-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;HaHa Harvest Comedy Festival @ Jersey City, NJ
    &lt;div id=&#34;haha-harvest-comedy-festival--jersey-city-nj&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#haha-harvest-comedy-festival--jersey-city-nj&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an annual festival that takes place in Jersey City and Hoboken. I was fortunate enough to be selected for this fest last year, and I&amp;rsquo;m quite pleased to be back in 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can grab tickets for the show I&amp;rsquo;m on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/comedy-cornucopia-tickets-2001000981802&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. For a full listing of all the fest&amp;rsquo;s shows, you can go &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.eventbrite.com/o/ha-ha-harvest-comedy-17984969650&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Friday, October 16th, 6:30 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;friday-october-16th-630-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#friday-october-16th-630-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Crooked Mouth Comedy Festival @ Endicott, NY
    &lt;div id=&#34;crooked-mouth-comedy-festival--endicott-ny&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#crooked-mouth-comedy-festival--endicott-ny&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An annual festival that takes place in the Crooked Mouth Brewery. This is another fest where I performed last year, and it was a great time. This year the show I&amp;rsquo;m on will be headlined by &lt;strong&gt;Chris Gethard&lt;/strong&gt;, who I&amp;rsquo;m excited to see live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can grab a ticket to the show I&amp;rsquo;m on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/cmcf26-night-2-early-show-with-chris-gethard-tickets-1990184127299?aff=erelpanelorg&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. You can find info, passes, and tickets to the other events on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.crookedmouthcomedyfest.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;festival website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Friday, November 13th, 6:30 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;friday-november-13th-630-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#friday-november-13th-630-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Saturday, November 14th, 5:00 PM and 7:30 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;saturday-november-14th-500-pm-and-730-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#saturday-november-14th-500-pm-and-730-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Helena Comedy Festival @ Helena, MT
    &lt;div id=&#34;helena-comedy-festival--helena-mt&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#helena-comedy-festival--helena-mt&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m fortunate to be featured in the second annual Helena Comedy Festival in Helena, Montana. I was actually accepted to this festival last year, but was unable to make it due to a conflict with the Mountain Fresh Comedy Festival that I had already committed to. I heard great things about the first festival, so I&amp;rsquo;m very glad to be accepted again this year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can grab tickets/passes to the shows I&amp;rsquo;m on and and all other festivals events &lt;a href=&#34;https://helenacomedyfestival.com/#schedule&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&amp;rsquo;s all I&amp;rsquo;ve got for you now. Thanks for checking in.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>My Shows in June 2026</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/shows-june-2026/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 19:02:04 -0400</pubDate>
      <author>vinnyseeram@vinnyseeram.com (Vinny Seeram)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/shows-june-2026/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ll be performing in a few shows in June that may interest you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Thursday, June 11th, 9 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;thursday-june-11th-9-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#thursday-june-11th-9-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;vinnydotcomedy @ QED Astoria
    &lt;div id=&#34;vinnydotcomedy--qed-astoria&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#vinnydotcomedy--qed-astoria&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is my semi-regular show hosted and produced by yours truly. I&amp;rsquo;m very excited for this line-up:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chanel Ali
Freddy G
Ethan Filler
Shannon Keye&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can grab tickets &lt;a href=&#34;https://qedastoria.com/products/vinnydotcomedy&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Wednesday, June 24th, 8 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;wednesday-june-24th-8-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#wednesday-june-24th-8-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Double A Comedy @ Spicy Moon Bowery
    &lt;div id=&#34;double-a-comedy--spicy-moon-bowery&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#double-a-comedy--spicy-moon-bowery&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A showcase hosted by Amber Born (to be seen on Jeopardy on July 3rd!) and Anant Kumar. It&amp;rsquo;s in the basement of Spicy Moon, a vegan Szechuan restaurant. Comedy takes you to the most interesting of basements. You&amp;rsquo;ll be able to order food and drinks for your table before the show, which is neat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can grab tickets &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/double-a-comedy-show-june-24th-tickets-1990878929471&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Friday, June 26th, 7 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;friday-june-26th-7-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#friday-june-26th-7-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Saturday, June 27th, 8 PM
    &lt;div id=&#34;saturday-june-27th-8-pm&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#saturday-june-27th-8-pm&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Hill People&amp;rsquo;s Comedy Festival @ Stamford, NY
    &lt;div id=&#34;hill-peoples-comedy-festival--stamford-ny&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#hill-peoples-comedy-festival--stamford-ny&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m fortunate to be featured in the 6th Annual Hill People&amp;rsquo;s Comedy Festival in Stamford, NY. The festival actually starts on Thursday, with a showcase of local comedians. Friday night at 7 PM is a showcase of all the festival participants (myself included).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Saturday night&amp;rsquo;s show will feature the festival&amp;rsquo;s headliner, Mia Jackson, for whom I will be featuring. You can grab tickets/passes to all the festivals events &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/6th-annual-hill-peoples-comedy-fest&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&amp;rsquo;s all I&amp;rsquo;ve got for you now. Thanks for checking in!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
